department-Triggermen = Triggermen
department-Triggermen-description = The Triggermen are a raider group that act much like the Mafia did in the past. They strong-arm businesses and hold people hostage to turn a profit. Player ranks: Associato > Soldato > Capo > Consigliere = Sotocapo > Don. Consigliere is a side promotion for a tactician, equal to the Sotocapo. Admin ranks: Membro Della Commissione > Capo Dei Capi.
job-name-triggermenboss = Don
job-name-triggermenenforcer = Capo
job-name-triggerman = Associato
job-description-triggermenboss = The highest player rank. Lead the family, oversee its rackets, and command the Sotocapo, Consigliere, and Capos.
job-description-triggermenenforcer = Lead a crew of Soldati and Associati, enforce the family's decisions, and keep its operations profitable.
job-description-triggerman = An associate working toward full membership. Support the crew and prove your loyalty to the family.
job-supervisors-triggermenboss = the Commission and the Capo Dei Capi
job-supervisors-triggermenenforcer = the Sotocapo and the Don
job-supervisors-triggerman = the Soldati, your Capo, the Sotocapo, and the Don
id-card-access-level-triggermen = Triggermen
id-card-access-level-triggermen-boss = Triggermen Don
